sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PaySvc as Payment Service
    participant Outbox as Outbox Table
    participant Broker as Message Broker Queue
    participant OrdSvc as Order Service
    participant DB as SQL Database

    PaySvc->>Outbox: Save PaymentSucceeded Event (Status: PENDING)
    PaySvc->>Broker: Publish PaymentSucceeded
    
    alt Order Service Down Outage
        Broker-->>OrdSvc: Event Dispatch Failed
        Note over Broker,Outbox: Event Remains Pending in Queue / Outbox
    else Order Service Recovers
        Broker->>OrdSvc: Consume PaymentSucceeded Event
        OrdSvc->>DB: Check Order Exists for Reservation ID
        alt Order Not Found
            OrdSvc->>DB: INSERT INTO orders (Status: CONFIRMED)
            OrdSvc->>Outbox: Mark Event PROCESSED
            OrdSvc-->>Broker: Acknowledge Message (ACK)
        else Order Exists
            OrdSvc-->>Broker: Idempotent Duplicate ACK
        end
    end
